      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "2. 网络基础",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67653219000000000800e928.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "f9c760bf3ff54a17ffa5ca7b16ae5779d5d2740111fb7920c0893188a9b9f258",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/67653219000000000800e928.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "465f1d3e6ed023042549f446b159074aac5bcf2c1b846b3f318629803d89b146",
        "source_projection_item_number": 2
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:67653219000000000800e928:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-7:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "问：请描述TCP三次握手的过程，并说明其重要性。\n答：TCP三次握手的过程包括：客户端发送SYN包请求连接，服务器回应ACK+SYN确认收到并请求建立连接，最后客户端再次发送ACK确认连接建立。这确保了双方都准备好接收和发送数据，并同意通信。\n问：当客户报告他们无法访问互联网时，你会采取哪些步骤进行诊断？\n答：对于客户报告的互联网访问问题，首先检查客户的本地网络设置（例如IP配置、DNS设置）。然后通过ping命令测试基本连通性，使用traceroute来定位可能的网络路径上的问题点，同时检查防火墙规则和路由器配置。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/67653219000000000800e928.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "f9c760bf3ff54a17ffa5ca7b16ae5779d5d2740111fb7920c0893188a9b9f258",
